rrent playing track row is visible when it\u2019s offscreen\u2014even when its parent folder is already the current browser folder.\n\n### Code changes\n- **`lib/widgets/void_browser.dart`**\n  - Extended `VoidBrowserController` with `playingTrackOutsideVisibleRegion` (`ValueNotifier<bool>`).\n  - `VoidBrowser` now computes whether the now-playing row overlaps the visible browser viewport and updates that notifier while mounted and during scrolling.\n- **`lib/screens/void_screen.dart`**\n  - Added a new crumb action (distinct from the existing \u201cfolder jump\u201d glyph):\n    - **Semantics label:** `jump to now-playing track`\n    - **Key:** `void-crumb-jump-to-playing-track`\n  - This action is shown **only on Linux**, **only when a track is playing**, and **only when** the track is in the current folder but **outside the visible viewport**.\n\n### Before / After screenshots\n- Before (offscreen now-playing track; action visible):\n  - `/workspace/.tmp/agent_shots/before_offscreen_now_playing.png`\n- After (activated; row scrolled into view):\n  - `/workspace/.tmp/agent_shots/after_scroll_to_now_playing.png`\n\nIf you want, I can also add a second regression script that verifies the action is *not* shown when `songInfo` is null (no track playing).","final_stop_reason":"stop","stop_reasons":{"completed":90},"truncated_turns":0,"final_error":null,"usage":{"aggregate":{"tokens":{"input":90763,"output":31148,"reasoning":24376,"cacheRead":3729152,"cacheWrite":0,"total":3851063},"cost_usd":{"total":0.13167064,"breakdown":{"input":0.01815260000000001,"output":0.03893500000000001,"cacheRead":0.07458303999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.13167064}},"cost_missing":false},"final":{"tokens":{"input":152,"output":1181,"reasoning":868,"cacheRead":74496,"cacheWrite":0,"total":75829},"cost_usd":{"total":0.0029965700000000005,"breakdown":{"input":3.0400000000000004e-05,"output":0.0014762500000000001,"cacheRead":0.00148992,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0029965700000000005}},"cost_miss